  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="14">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="14" corresp="#wit-york-gospels">For ðam þe ealle biscopas secgað þæt hit swyþe deop wið God to betanne þæt man aðas oððe wedd tobrece.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-york-gospels">For all the bishops declare that very severe amends must be made to God for the violation of oaths or pledges.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">weil alle Bischöfe sagen, dass es sehr tief gegenüber der Kirche gebüsst werden [müsse], wenn man Eide oder rechtsförmliche Versprechen verletzt.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">because all the bishops say that it [must] be atoned for very deeply before God if oaths or pledges are broken.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Earle supplies ‘is’, Pauli ‘beo’ after ‘deop’.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
